      "name": "indestructibility",
      "description": {
        "content": "VAST Cluster enables you to create and maintain immutable backups using a feature called Indestructibility. Snapshots and protection policies can be flagged indestructible and they are then protected from accidental or malicious deletion and modification. The indestructibility path represents the configuration of the indestructibility mechanism on the cluster.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
